    "details": "# Problem Description:\n\nThe SOCK_STREAM receive path in the unix socket implementation failed to\nfully detach control messages from the socket buffer before processing\nthem. Some error paths would free those messages, leaving freed data\nmbufs in the receive socket buffer.\n\n# Impact:\n\nAn unprivileged local user can exploit this use-after-free to escalate\nprivileges.\n",
